<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 24.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 24.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 165.31    0.98</p>
<p> 2   Centro Prop	    16.01    2.17</p>
<p> 3   Bk of Queen	    13.19    6.14</p>
<p> 4   MT Leyshon Gold	11.36    2.20</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	10.10    0.97</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.88    1.02</p>
<p> 7   Aust Tour		 9.62    0.78</p>
<p> 8   Natl Consol	     9.38    0.96</p>
<p> 9   BT Prop Trust	   9.27    1.76</p>
